WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.370
<b>What are you playing at?</b>

00:04.370 --> 00:08.300
<b>Can you not point
that dirty stick to my face?</b>

00:08.300 --> 00:09.880
<b>I'm not letting you go.</b>

00:10.550 --> 00:14.510
<b>Why? You're a loner.
This has nothing to do with you.</b>

00:14.510 --> 00:18.850
<b>Even a loner has something to protect!</b>

00:19.770 --> 00:22.350
<b>Oh? In that case...</b>

00:23.730 --> 00:26.150
<b>I'll kill you as well, then.</b>

00:38.990 --> 00:41.040
<b>Back in the white void room,</b>

00:41.660 --> 00:45.460
<b>I've made sure that
all the leftover skills are all trash.</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:51.210
<b>So, can those worthless skills of yours...</b>

00:52.170 --> 00:54.550
<b>...handle these?</b>

00:55.720 --> 00:57.470
<b>Activate Tweak.</b>

00:55.950 --> 00:58.120
<b>Tweak</b>

01:07.730 --> 01:09.980
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

01:09.980 --> 01:11.400
<b>♪Good Luck♪</b>

01:12.460 --> 01:21.560
<b>Loner Life in Another World</b>

01:12.460 --> 01:21.560
<b>Loner Life in Another World</b>

01:22.540 --> 01:25.210
<b>♪Shutting in my room
Makes me invincible on Mondays♪</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:27.580
<b>♪A single step outside
And it's trouble all over the place♪</b>

01:27.580 --> 01:30.250
<b>♪Someone fires a flare signaling a mayday♪</b>

01:30.250 --> 01:32.590
<b>♪I wish I could pretend I didn't hear it♪</b>

01:32.670 --> 01:35.090
<b>♪Enough with fair fights♪</b>

01:35.090 --> 01:37.590
<b>♪First come first serve is an illusion♪</b>

01:37.590 --> 01:39.850
<b>♪Leave everything to the dice♪</b>

01:39.850 --> 01:42.100
<b>♪But I'm bad with my rolls♪</b>

01:42.680 --> 01:45.180
<b>♪See, it may not be a clean cut♪</b>

01:45.180 --> 01:47.730
<b>♪But surprisingly
You're not just some leftover♪</b>

01:47.730 --> 01:50.190
<b>♪They have something that I don't?♪</b>

01:50.190 --> 01:53.480
<b>♪That's nonsense, I won't greed over that♪</b>

01:54.230 --> 01:57.400
<b>♪People decide who's a loner
And who is worthless♪</b>

01:57.400 --> 02:00.070
<b>♪Hold it right there young boy
You have some free time, right?♪</b>

02:00.070 --> 02:02.120
<b>♪Don't you just hate crowds?♪</b>

02:02.120 --> 02:05.080
<b>♪If you're bored, why not try a gamble?♪</b>

02:05.080 --> 02:07.960
<b>♪Manage the botches and luck then dance♪</b>

02:07.960 --> 02:10.580
<b>♪Not really into failing and falling♪</b>

02:10.580 --> 02:13.090
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

02:13.090 --> 02:16.010
<b>♪Doesn't cheating count as a skill?♪</b>

02:26.480 --> 02:33.860
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

02:33.860 --> 02:34.940
<b>♪Good Luck♪</b>

02:39.430 --> 02:43.430
<b>\hEpisode 7  Haruka and the Hooded Man\h</b>

02:43.530 --> 02:47.290
<b>He's fighting in the forest?
On his own?</b>

02:47.290 --> 02:48.660
<b>Haruka!</b>

02:49.160 --> 02:50.670
<b>Wait!</b>

02:50.670 --> 02:53.670
<b>Haruka can handle it.</b>

03:03.050 --> 03:04.640
<b>Haruka...</b>

03:07.680 --> 03:12.190
<b>It's hard to move my body!
Is this the effect of Tweak?!</b>

03:12.440 --> 03:14.440
<b>Nice dodge.</b>

03:16.320 --> 03:18.110
<b>How about these ones, though?</b>

03:25.580 --> 03:30.330
<b>I thought you were a small fry,
but you're actually pretty good, Haruka.</b>

03:30.330 --> 03:31.790
<b>Gee, thanks...</b>

03:32.750 --> 03:35.790
<b>I have a question before I kill you.</b>

03:35.790 --> 03:38.000
<b>How long have you been suspicious of me?</b>

03:38.000 --> 03:41.760
<b>I thought you were weird
from the beginning.</b>

03:41.840 --> 03:45.970
<b>It was weird seeing you
group up with the delinquents</b>

03:45.970 --> 03:47.850
<b>when you're a math genius
and a loner as well.</b>

03:48.520 --> 03:50.600
<b>I knew there was a reason.</b>

03:50.600 --> 03:54.480
<b>Oh? You're surprisingly sharp.</b>

03:54.480 --> 03:57.520
<b>So you're not just
some bookworm loser, huh?</b>

03:57.520 --> 04:00.490
<b>All right, I want to ask as well.</b>

04:01.280 --> 04:03.700
<b>When did you think up this plan of yours?</b>

04:04.820 --> 04:06.910
<b>From the beginning.</b>

04:07.280 --> 04:09.660
<b>It was after Hijack was taken,</b>

04:09.680 --> 04:13.600
<b>Tweak: Allows slight manipulation
of individual targets</b>

04:10.040 --> 04:13.670
<b>but once I saw how Tweak worked,
my plan was completed.</b>

04:13.670 --> 04:15.920
<b>By manipulating those idiot thugs,</b>

04:15.920 --> 04:18.420
<b>I have become
the strongest one, like this!</b>

04:19.290 --> 04:20.550
<b>Oh no!</b>

04:20.960 --> 04:22.550
<b>This is it for you.</b>

04:28.050 --> 04:30.520
<b>That was anticlimactic.</b>

04:34.980 --> 04:36.190
<b>What?</b>

04:39.570 --> 04:42.570
<b>He's absorbing the magic?!</b>

04:52.040 --> 04:55.830
<b>I never tested it before,
but it worked!</b>

04:56.920 --> 04:59.170
<b>It was the Mistletoe Sprig
that got fused the other day.</b>

04:59.670 --> 05:03.170
<b>Now that I know what its previously
unknown effect is, it really helped.</b>

05:00.650 --> 05:03.650
<b>Magic Absorption</b>

05:04.170 --> 05:07.180
<b>Now it's my turn!</b>

05:08.550 --> 05:11.560
<b>Now when he's not
using any weapon skill!</b>

05:12.810 --> 05:14.810
<b>Now when he's still surprised!</b>

05:15.560 --> 05:17.560
<b>I'll end it in one blow!</b>

05:21.940 --> 05:24.780
<b>Too bad. Did you really think
I'd give you an opening?</b>

05:25.780 --> 05:29.030
<b>It doesn't matter
if my offensive magic didn't work.</b>

05:29.620 --> 05:31.280
<b>So that was just a bluff?</b>

05:32.870 --> 05:37.750
<b>My bad, I was just thinking about
which weapon I'll be using to break you.</b>

05:38.710 --> 05:39.810
<b>A sword?</b>

05:41.090 --> 05:42.630
<b>Or perhaps a spear?</b>

05:43.340 --> 05:47.380
<b>Which one will it be...?</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:49.090
<b>Actually,</b>

05:49.800 --> 05:53.540
<b>I'll just break you
with everything I have. How's that?</b>

05:53.550 --> 05:54.810
<b>Let's start with this!</b>

05:57.440 --> 05:58.520
<b>You got to be kidding!</b>

05:58.520 --> 05:59.650
<b>And next!</b>

06:01.250 --> 06:03.440
<b>His attacks are all over the place!</b>

06:03.440 --> 06:05.110
<b>Well?</b>

06:06.030 --> 06:07.740
<b>I can't block all of them!</b>

06:07.740 --> 06:08.820
<b>Over here.</b>

06:09.530 --> 06:10.990
<b>How about this?!</b>

06:11.910 --> 06:13.450
<b>There's more!</b>

06:13.450 --> 06:14.370
<b>What?!</b>

06:44.270 --> 06:47.320
<b>Well? Feel like giving up yet?</b>

06:49.400 --> 06:50.910
<b>This is bad...</b>

06:52.780 --> 06:55.660
<b>Even if I make use of the openings
from the weapon skills,</b>

06:55.660 --> 06:59.290
<b>I can't keep track
of all the different attacks!</b>

07:01.790 --> 07:05.710
<b>If he can use all those weapon skills,
that means...</b>

07:07.090 --> 07:10.970
<b>You used Copycat to copy
our classmate's skills, didn't you?</b>

07:11.110 --> 07:14.200
<b>Copycat</b>

07:11.110 --> 07:14.200
<b>Allows the user to copy any skill
and use it as efficiently as the original</b>

07:11.430 --> 07:14.220
<b>Oh, you know about that?</b>

07:14.730 --> 07:17.150
<b>I've heard from the Jocks.</b>

07:17.720 --> 07:21.600
<b>You're after the Class Rep's
Hijack skill, right?</b>

07:22.600 --> 07:24.350
<b>You want to use Copycat on her Hijack,</b>

07:24.900 --> 07:29.240
<b>and use that to take the real thing
from her, don't you?</b>

07:29.240 --> 07:30.740
<b>That's right.</b>

07:31.740 --> 07:36.490
<b>Once I took the original cheat skills
from the remaining ones still alive,</b>

07:36.490 --> 07:39.750
<b>I will be the strongest cheat skill user.</b>

07:39.750 --> 07:45.790
<b>In other words, he used Copycat
on all the guys he took out.</b>

07:45.790 --> 07:47.250
<b>What a terrifying cheat skill!</b>

07:47.750 --> 07:50.550
<b>I'm not letting you get in my way!</b>

07:52.550 --> 07:55.890
<b>If I wait, he'll just hit me
with a hail of weapon skills!</b>

07:58.470 --> 08:00.850
<b>But even if I go on the offensive,</b>

08:02.390 --> 08:04.850
<b>he'll easily avoid me using Apparition.</b>

08:10.570 --> 08:13.200
<b>I have no way to fight back...</b>

08:13.910 --> 08:16.660
<b>You finally gave up, huh?!</b>

08:17.870 --> 08:19.490
<b>Just kidding.</b>

08:25.670 --> 08:27.500
<b>Say, Tanaka.</b>

08:27.500 --> 08:30.340
<b>You can only use the same skill
three times, don't you?</b>

08:30.840 --> 08:32.130
<b>What?!</b>

08:34.180 --> 08:36.470
<b>Oh, did that hit the mark?</b>

08:36.470 --> 08:39.140
<b>Why can't I hit you now?!</b>

08:39.140 --> 08:41.930
<b>This makes no sense!
This defies my deductions!</b>

08:44.230 --> 08:47.940
<b>I figured out the weakness
of your Copycat skill.</b>

08:48.360 --> 08:49.570
<b>That's impossible!</b>

08:49.570 --> 08:54.030
<b>I let you fire off your skills on purpose
to find your weaknesses.</b>

08:54.030 --> 08:58.530
<b>Then I realized you tend
not to use any skill more than twice.</b>

08:58.530 --> 09:04.710
<b>He's afraid of using up
his limited amount of copied skills.</b>

09:04.710 --> 09:06.710
<b>You bastard!</b>

09:07.380 --> 09:09.460
<b>If I keep dodging, I can win!</b>

09:09.960 --> 09:13.380
<b>So what if you know that?!</b>

09:13.380 --> 09:16.630
<b>I still have an armory of weapon skills!</b>

09:16.630 --> 09:18.090
<b>Look here, Tanaka.</b>

09:18.600 --> 09:20.810
<b>I'm used to your speed as well.</b>

09:23.140 --> 09:25.690
<b>So all those weapon skills mean nothing.</b>

09:26.190 --> 09:28.190
<b>This is still my turn!</b>

09:33.940 --> 09:37.910
<b>I finally got this chance,
I'm not throwing it away!</b>

09:37.910 --> 09:40.950
<b>You can't use your Apparition skill
after you use it too much, do you?!</b>

09:46.370 --> 09:48.370
<b>He still have that much strength left?</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:54.880
<b>Of course I won't win so easily,
he has cheat skills.</b>

09:57.720 --> 09:59.590
<b>How...</b>

09:59.590 --> 10:02.850
<b>How can some loser like you beat me up?!</b>

10:02.850 --> 10:04.850
<b>This makes no sense!</b>

10:07.600 --> 10:10.650
<b>But I still have my ace on my sleeve.</b>

10:10.650 --> 10:12.270
<b>Ace?</b>

10:12.270 --> 10:13.650
<b>He still have more?</b>

10:14.150 --> 10:17.490
<b>All the previous cheat skills
are nothing compared to this.</b>

10:17.920 --> 10:19.340
<b>Let me show you!</b>

10:21.910 --> 10:24.910
<b>Huh? It looks just like his other skills.</b>

10:25.410 --> 10:26.660
<b>Right!</b>

10:26.660 --> 10:27.910
<b>Left!</b>

10:27.910 --> 10:29.170
<b>Next one is...</b>

10:32.210 --> 10:33.130
<b>Above?!</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:35.130
<b>This is the end for you!</b>

10:37.050 --> 10:38.630
<b>This is his ultimate skill?</b>

10:39.550 --> 10:41.010
<b>But it's nothing amazing.</b>

10:44.990 --> 10:46.430
<b>Is this just a distraction?</b>

10:48.890 --> 10:50.350
<b>Is the next one the actual attack?!</b>

10:54.360 --> 10:56.280
<b>And checkmate.</b>

11:04.510 --> 11:05.760
<b>Instant Death</b>

11:04.630 --> 11:05.790
<b>Instant Death!</b>

11:38.440 --> 11:41.030
<b>You finally croaked.</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:43.490
<b>Even made pull my ace on you.</b>

11:44.530 --> 11:47.910
<b>To be honest, I didn't want
to waste my skill charges.</b>

11:49.120 --> 11:53.880
<b>But whatever, once I got Hijack,
I can use them as much as I want.</b>

11:55.040 --> 11:56.710
<b>So long, Haruka.</b>

11:57.630 --> 11:59.800
<b>Enjoy your eternal sleep.</b>

12:13.560 --> 12:14.520
<b>Hey.</b>

12:19.780 --> 12:22.280
<b>You're just going to leave
after kicking my head?</b>

12:22.610 --> 12:25.700
<b>W-why are you still alive?!</b>

12:25.700 --> 12:28.450
<b>You're level 11!
Instant Death should've worked!</b>

12:28.450 --> 12:31.290
<b>My calculations are flawless!</b>

12:31.790 --> 12:35.880
<b>Oh, I have General Health skill, so that
kind of thing won't work as well on me.</b>

12:35.310 --> 12:42.740
<b>General Health</b>

12:35.310 --> 12:42.740
<b>Harder to be inflicted
by sickness (status effect)</b>

12:35.880 --> 12:38.960
<b>Since Instant Death is categorized
as a status effect,</b>

12:38.960 --> 12:42.260
<b>its success rate must've gone down
thanks to General Health.</b>

12:43.720 --> 12:46.220
<b>Not to mention, I capped my luck stat.</b>

12:46.720 --> 12:50.930
<b>After getting transported here,
I maxed out my luck stat.</b>

12:50.930 --> 12:53.210
<b>And so, it reduced the Instant Death skill
success rate to as low as possible.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:57.730
<b>And so, it reduced the Instant Death skill
success rate to as low as possible.</b>

12:57.730 --> 13:01.400
<b>But you collapsed!
Isn't that because it worked?!</b>

13:01.400 --> 13:05.170
<b>Nah, it was just an act.</b>

13:05.170 --> 13:07.720
<b>I mean, you said it was
your ace in your sleeve.</b>

13:09.080 --> 13:12.040
<b>Didn't expect you would
kick me in the head, though.</b>

13:12.040 --> 13:13.580
<b>That's impossible...</b>

13:13.580 --> 13:17.040
<b>In the first place, how can you move?
How can you even attack?!</b>

13:17.040 --> 13:21.170
<b>I've been using my Tweak to hinder
your movement since the fight started!</b>

13:22.050 --> 13:24.880
<b>It's thanks to
the worthless skill you made fun of.</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:26.880
<b>Do you know what Blockhead means?</b>

13:26.880 --> 13:30.050
<b>It makes you into a good-for-nothing!
Just like yourself!</b>

13:30.050 --> 13:35.180
<b>That's right, but it can
also mean a wooden puppet.</b>

13:36.100 --> 13:38.060
<b>So in case of a situation just like this,</b>

13:38.440 --> 13:43.070
<b>I've trained to move my body externally
like a puppet on a string.</b>

13:43.570 --> 13:46.200
<b>That's why, even if you use Tweak on me...</b>

13:44.760 --> 13:45.630
<b>Tweak</b>

13:46.990 --> 13:48.490
<b>Blockhead!</b>

13:47.220 --> 13:48.470
<b>Blockhead</b>

13:48.490 --> 13:51.240
<b>...I can still force myself to move.</b>

13:55.040 --> 13:56.660
<b>Do these look worthless to you?</b>

13:57.780 --> 13:58.740
<b>Even if you do,</b>

13:59.250 --> 14:02.090
<b>these worthless skills
that you never even consider...</b>

14:02.750 --> 14:04.260
<b>They're not that bad, huh?</b>

14:04.630 --> 14:09.300
<b>They're just leftover skills!
I won't accept it!</b>

14:13.680 --> 14:16.180
<b>You're wasting your skill charges again.</b>

14:16.180 --> 14:20.060
<b>Shut up!</b>

14:21.520 --> 14:23.480
<b>I did it...</b>

14:23.480 --> 14:25.690
<b>I told you, it's useless.</b>

14:27.650 --> 14:29.320
<b>It's over.</b>

14:29.320 --> 14:33.700
<b>No way...
But my calculations should be perfect...</b>

14:33.700 --> 14:34.740
<b>Calculations?</b>

14:35.240 --> 14:37.040
<b>Isn't it obvious?!</b>

14:37.040 --> 14:40.710
<b>One plus one equals two! It's absolute!
So how come?!</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:42.590
<b>One plus one?</b>

14:42.590 --> 14:45.250
<b>Well, true, the answer to that is two.</b>

14:45.250 --> 14:48.470
<b>But that is when it comes
to the world we came from.</b>

14:48.470 --> 14:51.640
<b>In there, that's the right answer.
It's absolute.</b>

14:51.640 --> 14:54.220
<b>But things are different here.</b>

14:55.890 --> 14:58.430
<b>It's a fantasy world
with swords and magic.</b>

14:58.430 --> 15:01.100
<b>Why would common deductions work here?</b>

15:02.110 --> 15:05.070
<b>One plus one is more than just "two".</b>

15:05.070 --> 15:09.110
<b>This is a place where unknown numbers
are all over the place.</b>

15:10.700 --> 15:12.120
<b>It can't be...</b>

15:14.080 --> 15:15.740
<b>Every day was so dull.</b>

15:16.590 --> 15:19.790
<b>Lessons mean nothing to a genius like me.</b>

15:19.790 --> 15:23.750
<b>A boring school life where
I'm surrounded by moronic people.</b>

15:24.290 --> 15:27.510
<b>I wished that these boring days
would come to an end.</b>

15:27.840 --> 15:29.260
<b>And it did.</b>

15:30.680 --> 15:33.430
<b>With the stunning sight before my eyes,</b>

15:35.050 --> 15:37.890
<b>I can feel excitement boiling
from my very own core.</b>

15:38.850 --> 15:41.390
<b>The very moment I saw the skill list,</b>

15:42.150 --> 15:43.690
<b>I thought of a plan.</b>

15:44.360 --> 15:47.900
<b>If I used it correctly, it's a surefire
way to escape boredom.</b>

15:48.400 --> 15:50.900
<b>That's why,
with all the situations I'm thrust into,</b>

15:50.900 --> 15:54.410
<b>I planned for the most exciting future.</b>

15:54.410 --> 15:59.410
<b>Even if it means I would have
to kill my classmates.</b>

15:59.910 --> 16:04.420
<b>Once I killed everyone and took
all their cheat skills for myself,</b>

16:04.420 --> 16:07.130
<b>I would've been all-powerful!
I'd be unstoppable!</b>

16:07.130 --> 16:08.630
<b>I would've been perfect!</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:11.260
<b>So how come...?</b>

16:12.010 --> 16:15.180
<b>How come someone who only
has worthless skills like you...</b>

16:15.430 --> 16:18.930
<b>How come you can stand in my way?!</b>

16:25.690 --> 16:29.280
<b>It's been a long fight,
so he should've run out of tricks!</b>

16:29.280 --> 16:30.400
<b>This is my chance!</b>

16:38.120 --> 16:39.700
<b>Long Range Control?</b>

16:39.700 --> 16:42.920
<b>Damnit, you still have a skill like that?</b>

16:43.420 --> 16:46.340
<b>Looks like victory is mine nevertheless.</b>

16:49.170 --> 16:52.550
<b>Take that! One plus one still equals two!</b>

16:52.550 --> 16:55.840
<b>My chance of winning is 100%!</b>

16:55.840 --> 16:57.760
<b>You're misunderstanding things.</b>

17:02.850 --> 17:05.550
<b>You may have calculated things,</b>

17:05.550 --> 17:07.480
<b>but you didn't count
for anything else.</b>

17:07.480 --> 17:11.480
<b>You relied too much on your cheat skills
and didn't put any effort of your own.</b>

17:11.480 --> 17:14.490
<b>Everyone in the class
gave their best effort.</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:16.490
<b>Everyone, except you.</b>

17:17.660 --> 17:20.370
<b>Stay away... Don't come any closer!</b>

17:20.370 --> 17:23.450
<b>Get away from me!</b>

17:23.910 --> 17:25.460
<b>Gambit!</b>

17:24.060 --> 17:25.440
<b>Gambit</b>

17:29.630 --> 17:31.500
<b>Good bye, Tanaka.</b>

17:40.560 --> 17:42.810
<b>All I have are worthless skills.</b>

17:45.640 --> 17:48.100
<b>I don't have any straight-up cheat skills,</b>

17:49.190 --> 17:51.190
<b>but I have my tricks.</b>

17:57.410 --> 17:59.950
<b>That was a pretty close fight.</b>

18:00.700 --> 18:04.370
<b>One mistake, and I would've lost.</b>

18:05.660 --> 18:10.920
<b>Damnit, the moment I turned off Blockhead,
all the pain immediately came to me.</b>

18:11.710 --> 18:16.220
<b>My mana is pretty much empty
after I used Gambit as well.</b>

18:18.380 --> 18:19.800
<b>Class Rep...</b>

18:21.390 --> 18:22.600
<b>Everyone...</b>

18:23.310 --> 18:24.430
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

18:32.110 --> 18:35.070
<b>I don't think I can go on...</b>

18:40.320 --> 18:41.490
<b>Haruka!</b>

18:47.540 --> 18:50.080
<b>Oh, it's the Nerds.</b>

18:50.080 --> 18:53.040
<b>Where the heck
have you been all this time?</b>

18:53.040 --> 18:56.050
<b>You never showed up,
so we came to get you instead.</b>

18:58.170 --> 19:01.390
<b>It's our turn to help you now.</b>

19:01.390 --> 19:03.850
<b>You Nerds...</b>

19:03.850 --> 19:05.180
<b>All right, go and drink this.</b>

19:07.680 --> 19:10.730
<b>Can you walk?
You can take your time.</b>

19:17.780 --> 19:21.160
<b>So, uh, what are you guys doing
in the forest in the first place?</b>

19:21.160 --> 19:22.830
<b>Uh, well...</b>

19:23.200 --> 19:25.790
<b>When we returned to town
after going to a dungeon,</b>

19:25.790 --> 19:30.330
<b>everyone was freaking out
about you going to fight in the forest.</b>

19:30.330 --> 19:33.830
<b>We can't just do nothing
after hearing that.</b>

19:33.840 --> 19:35.830
<b>So we hurried to the forest.</b>

19:35.830 --> 19:36.880
<b>I see.</b>

19:41.840 --> 19:43.470
<b>Haruka!</b>

19:43.470 --> 19:44.350
<b>Class Rep...</b>

19:44.350 --> 19:45.560
<b>Hey!</b>

19:45.560 --> 19:47.100
<b>Welcome back!</b>

19:48.350 --> 19:50.100
<b>Come on, you made us all worry!</b>

19:50.100 --> 19:52.310
<b>I've grilled some fish while waiting.</b>

19:52.310 --> 19:55.860
<b>It's been a moment...
This kind of crowd is hard for a loner...</b>

19:55.860 --> 19:56.860
<b>Haruka!</b>

20:06.490 --> 20:09.250
<b>Come on, let's head back to our lodging.</b>

20:09.250 --> 20:12.250
<b>The bath's open.
I'll wash your back for you.</b>

20:12.250 --> 20:15.840
<b>Huh? Wait, hey, listen to me!</b>

20:18.750 --> 20:19.880
<b>We're sorry!</b>

20:22.880 --> 20:26.470
<b>You guys helped us survive,</b>

20:26.470 --> 20:29.180
<b>and yet we kicked you out of the camp...</b>

20:29.180 --> 20:30.520
<b>Oh, and also...</b>

20:35.690 --> 20:37.020
<b>Thank you...</b>

20:39.860 --> 20:41.490
<b>You're welcome.</b>

20:41.820 --> 20:46.270
<b>I protected the Class Rep,
and everyone in the class got reunited.</b>

20:46.270 --> 20:48.450
<b>That means I'm no longer
needed here, right?</b>

20:50.950 --> 20:53.910
<b>Now let's go back to my loner life...</b>

20:54.960 --> 20:57.170
<b>Where do you think you're going now?</b>

20:58.540 --> 20:59.710
<b>Class Rep?!</b>

20:59.710 --> 21:02.630
<b>Haruka, don't you have something
to say when you return?</b>

21:02.630 --> 21:07.010
<b>Uh, "I'm home!' or something like that...?</b>

21:10.600 --> 21:12.390
<b>Then why?</b>

21:13.060 --> 21:15.100
<b>Why did you try to leave?</b>

21:15.600 --> 21:17.810
<b>Huh? Class Rep?</b>

21:19.610 --> 21:22.280
<b>I was really worried, you know?</b>

21:22.280 --> 21:25.360
<b>What if you died out there?</b>

21:25.360 --> 21:29.070
<b>What if you never came back?</b>

21:29.080 --> 21:32.790
<b>Sorry, Class Rep.
Did I make you cry again?</b>

21:34.120 --> 21:36.080
<b>I'm not crying today.</b>

21:36.620 --> 21:40.090
<b>After all, you came back.</b>

21:42.880 --> 21:44.130
<b>That said...</b>

21:45.130 --> 21:48.640
<b>I will be scolding you,
along with everyone.</b>

21:51.640 --> 21:54.390
<b>- Come, let's head back.
- Wait...</b>

21:54.390 --> 21:55.850
<b>You always do this, Haruka.</b>

21:55.850 --> 21:57.940
<b>We really can't let our guard down.</b>

21:57.940 --> 22:00.650
<b>This will be a thorough one,
so you better prepare yourself.</b>

22:02.020 --> 22:04.610
<b>Welcome back, Haruka.</b>

22:17.750 --> 22:22.290
<b>♪The sunset I saw on my own was beautiful♪</b>

22:22.290 --> 22:27.550
<b>♪I ended the day
Without having anyone to talk about it♪</b>

22:27.550 --> 22:32.140
<b>♪I care not for the loneliness and moved on♪</b>

22:32.140 --> 22:37.350
<b>♪One thing after another
New stuff keeps appearing before me♪</b>

22:37.350 --> 22:41.940
<b>♪I went through so many things
Yet I can't imagine how it will go♪</b>

22:41.940 --> 22:44.150
<b>♪How silly I am♪</b>

22:44.150 --> 22:49.240
<b>♪They might look bland
Yet that's not always the case♪</b>

22:49.240 --> 22:54.290
<b>♪They toy with the careless me
Who still hasn't learned my lesson♪</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:58.960
<b>♪As always, we're all loners♪</b>

22:58.960 --> 23:03.920
<b>♪Each time we pass by
We say our hellos and goodbyes♪</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:08.760
<b>♪I care not
I simply want to play for today♪</b>

23:08.760 --> 23:13.930
<b>♪Having a little fun
Before saying good night♪</b>

23:16.560 --> 23:22.730
<b>♪I hum as I think of the next time
We meet again♪</b>

23:26.320 --> 23:32.620
<b>♪I hum on in the middle of
My lonely journey♪</b>
